nd its unending effort to invade the rest of the world. It must be stopped.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 40, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYvHwdL", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 40, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "stable", "id": 8921587, "raw_content": "It's been gone for a while now for it to play out like this but Talafreako winning really settled it. He is quite possibly one of the most unsettling candidates this entire election which means it's actually much worse in Texas than tonight's display, had Dems run someone that didn't look like a demon wearing a skin suit it would have been an even bigger loss. What remains of genuine Texans with an American spirit couldn't overcome it, and it's likely Texas is the next California and we are living in the last 2 years of a Republican president short of another domestic war which no one appears to have the stomach for.", "author": "f_bastiat", "created": 1793784672173, "profile_picture": "YpHIqZ5iGXTw", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "jcd_007", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Texas officially lost it's identity tonight", "last_comment_created": 1793790339399, "content": "<p>It's been gone for a while now for it to play out like this but Talafreako winning really settled it. He is quite possibly one of the most unsettling candidates this entire election